# Where Gantry looks for installed projects, one parent directory per line.
# A project named NAME is the directory <parent>/NAME, found by
# `gantry --installed NAME`, boot (gantry-boot.service) and remote control.
# `*` and `?` match within one path component. A name found in more than
# one place is refused. Keep this file owned by root and not writable by
# others: remote control refuses to run otherwise.
/etc/gantry
/mnt/*
